  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nWelcome to the world of trading used (or stolen) cars!<p></p>\n<p>Got little money and nothing to lose? We were waiting for you!</p>\n<p>In <b>Used Cars Simulator</b>, you’ll fix up cars, put them up for sale, grow your business in an old shed, drive around an abandoned city, drink beer, and wander the desert with a metal detector.</p>\n<p>And it all starts when you meet a beautiful woman in a red dress at your favorite bar… Are you in?</p>\n<p><b>FIND A GOOD OFFER</b><br>\nIn <b>Used Cars Simulator</b>, you’ll learn how to make money by trading cars.</p>\n<p>First, find a good deal. Check the car’s condition, negotiate the price, and if everything looks good – just buy it.</p>\n<p><b>FIX THE CAR</b><br>\nFix the dents, order and install missing parts, wash the car, repaint it, and put it up for sale. If it wasn’t yours, you’d probably want to buy it yourself!</p>\n<p><b>BE BAD</b><br>\nIn <b>Used Cars Simulator,</b> there are many ways to get cars. Are they all legal? Sure – as long as the cops don’t catch you.</p>\n<p><b>HAVE FUN</b><br>\nAfter work, have some fun – drift, jump, and compare your scores with other players on the leaderboards.</p>\n<p><b>Key Features of Used Cars Simulator:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Car Trading &amp; Flipping\n</li><li>Story &amp; Quests\n</li><li>Physics &amp; Sandbox\n</li><li>Illegal Activities\n</li><li>Police Interactions\n</li><li>World Exploration\n</li><li>Upgrades &amp; Economy\n</li></ul>\n",
